error[RDX0126]: expected a function for this operator to stand for
  --> operator_shape.sdx:7:10
  |
7 | infixl 6 <+> =
  |          ^^^
  = help: a declaration is an **alias**: `infixl 6 <+> = Set::union` makes `a <+> b` emit `Set::union(a, b)`. It declares no function of its own, because no Rust function can be named `<+>`

